Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:29.00,OP - JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}明日　きみと話せるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.88,0:02:29.00,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,0)\bord1.5\1a&H20&\c&HFFFFFF&\blur16}若明日能与你同语
Dialogue: 1,0:02:25.88,0:02:29.00,OP - CN,,0,0,0,,若明日能与你同语
